# Hosts that block automated requests outright, so a failure here tells us
# nothing about whether the link actually works in a browser.
https://hbr\.org/.*
https://store\.hbr\.org/.*
https://www\.forbes\.com/.*
https://finance\.yahoo\.com/.*
https://www\.yahoo\.com/.*
https://www\.aol\.com/.*

# The published artifact. It is a client-rendered page behind Cloudflare, so an
# unauthenticated checker gets a challenge or an empty shell either way — a
# result here would say nothing about whether the link actually works.
https://claude\.ai/.*

# Relative GitHub shortcuts (../../issues/...) that only resolve once rendered
# on github.com, not on a local filesystem.
^\.\./\.\./.*
